umbnail/ago_downloaded.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-179.99999550841463,-88.99999992161116],[179.99999550841463,88.99999992161116]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"102100","accessInformation":null,"classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services2.arcgis.com/IwgfhtT0PgoXVtxM/arcgis/rest/services/FEMA_Damage_Assessments_Public_view/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":813,"scoreCompleteness":46,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792184400000},{"id":"bff3d54f5bd94e84a118a4eb3ada9382","owner":"rgibson@co.winneshiek.ia.us","created":1753388355000,"modified":1754935361000,"guid":null,"name":"AddressesPublic_view","title":"AddressesPublic_view","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service","View Service"],"description":"<div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:24px; margin:16px 0px; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>This layer includes the authoritative address points for Winneshiek County, Iowa. It serves as the primary and most up-to-date source for address locations within the county. The layer is updated on a monthly basis from a database maintained by Winneshiek County GIS, ensuring the accuracy and currency of the data.<\/div><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:24px; margin:16px 0px; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>This layer is ideal for various applications and analyses requiring accurate address data, including:<\/div><ul><li><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'>Emergency Services Dispatch<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'>Parcel Management and Assessment<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'>Urban Planning and Development<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'>Demographic Analysis<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'>Routing and Navigation<\/span><\/span><\/li><\/ul><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:20px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:28px; margin:30px 0px; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>Data source<\/div><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:24px; margin:16px 0px; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>The data originates from a geodatabase, maintained by the Winneshiek County IT department, which serves as the official record of addresses within the county.<\/div><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:20px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:28px; margin:30px 0px; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>Update frequency<\/div><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:24px; margin:16px 0px; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>The layer is updated monthly to reflect changes and additions to the address database.<\/div><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:20px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:28px; margin:30px 0px; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>Usage<\/div><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:24px; margin:16px 0px; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>This layer is intended to be the primary source for address points in Winneshiek County. The layer is shared with the organization so that it can be used in any applications or analyses requiring precise and current address information within the area. Users are encouraged to create views of this layer as needed for their own applications. This layer should not be used directly in applications and is not intended for editing in web maps or applications. Any joined views created by users may be removed if changes to the schema of this layer are required.<\/div>","tags":[],"snippet":"This is a public view layer of the address publishing feature service. It is maintained for use in public applications requiring county address points.","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.JPEG","documentation":null,"extent":[[-92.08930789803803,43.076921090588485],[-91.59299147132593,43.50661996914542]],"categories":["/Categories/Administrative units"],"spatialReference":"102100","accessInformation":"Winneshiek County GIS Department; Winneshiek County Emergency Management; Winneshiek County Board. Data is maintained in collaboration with local emergency services and county staff.","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"<p>This data is provided for informational and planning purposes only. While efforts are made to ensure the accuracy and currency of the information, Winneshiek County makes no warranties, express or implied, regarding the completeness, accuracy, or reliability of the data. Users are responsible for verifying all information before making decisions based on it.<\/p><p>This layer should not be used for legal, engineering, or survey purposes. Redistribution or commercial use of the data without written permission from Winneshiek County is prohibited.<\/p>","culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services2.arcgis.com/IwgfhtT0PgoXVtxM/arcgis/rest/services/AddressesPublic_view/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":256,"scoreCompleteness":83,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792184400000,"source":"Winneshiek County GIS","licenseConstraintId":"custom"}]}